Belinda has been named the new brand ambassador for Levi’s in Latin America.&nbsp;

The Mexican pop star—known for her impact in music, TV, film and fashion—joins the&nbsp;brand’s global platform, Behind Every Original campaign, which celebrates individuals who defy convention, inspire self-expression and drive culture.

&#8220;Everyone has a story that defines who they are, and I have always sought to express mine through music, fashion, and creativity,” Belinda said in a press statement. “I am excited to join Levi’s and be part of a platform that celebrates the originality within each person.&#8221;

News of the Levi’s alliance comes on the heels of Beli having a fruitful year.&nbsp;

