The singer and actress recently joined Disney and Pixar’s Toy Story 5 as the voice of the new character Lilypap—a modern toy, interactive tablet—in the Spanish-language dub for Latin America.&nbsp;

Last month, Belinda and Los Ángeles Azules performed “Por Ella,” included in the Official FIFA World Cup 2026 Album , at the FIFA Countdown Concert in Mexico as well as at the World Cup opening ceremony ahead of the Mexico and South Africa inaugural match at Estadio Azteca on June 11.&nbsp;&nbsp;

“Por Ella” peaked at No. 24 on the Hot Latin Pop Songs chart, dated June 27.&nbsp;

“Life has been a journey full of learning, growth, and constant evolution — both personally and artistically,” she previously said to Billboard when she was honored with the Evolution Award at the 2025 Billboard Latin Women in Music gala. “I keep working while having many goals [&#8230;] I’m always thinking about new ideas, new songs, new challenges, new projects.”
